          {
            "text": "The inspected config.json files for Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B, Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B-Base, Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B-FP8 and Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B-GPTQ-Int4 also each declare Qwen3MoeForCausalLM. Each therefore matches the same repaired mapping, independently of its unchanged dimensions and checkpoint quantization metadata.",
